# Docker Compose – Security

Add this to **every** service in Compose files so containers cannot gain new privileges:

```yaml
services:
  some_service:
    security_opt:
      - no-new-privileges:true
```

Place it near the top of the service block (e.g. after `restart` or `container_name`).

When adding new services, include this block so all containers follow the same hardening.
